# TLS material — never commit
wildcard.crt
wildcard.key
*.pem
packages/frontend/.build-stamp
packages/backend/uploads

# Key material, by extension rather than by path. The two private keys that
# reached this repository's history did so from paths that are now listed
# above — but only after the fact. `*.pem` was already covered; these were not,
# so a .key outside those two directories, or a PKCS#12 bundle anywhere, was
# still committable. wildcard.key is a real RSA key living in this working
# tree; it has never been committed, and that should stay true by rule rather
# than by luck.
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
!**/*.public.key

# SBOM output. The workflow generates this per run and uploads it as a build
# artifact; ci-local.sh writes it to the same path. Generated, not source.
compliance/evidence/releases/
